  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I’d like to be able to see and use PC/PCVR avatars on Quest 2. Thing is, I lag a bit sometimes even without it, but it’s just some simple dynamic bones.\nSolution: add a option in the “advanced options” menu for seeing/using PC/PCVR avatars even if it means lag, warn the user about intense lag on their Quest as a possibility too.\nSome of us Quest users have modified our Quests slightly to give the CPU and GPU a bit more power at the cost of more heat, because you can do two more options besides the default power level:\nLevel 2, and Level 4.\nDue to these mods, we could have decent performance even using/seeing PC avatars on Quest.",
